  "releaseNotes": "WorkflowForge.Extensions.Persistence 2.2.0\n\nBREAKING\n- Removed PersistenceOptions.MaxVersions and the duplicate PersistenceMiddlewareOptions type. IWorkflowPersistenceProvider stores one snapshot per key, so versioning was not implementable, and the duplicate type bound the same configuration section with different defaults.\n\nFixed\n- PersistOnOperationComplete, PersistOnWorkflowComplete and PersistOnFailure now each change when a checkpoint is written. PersistOnFailure in particular wrote nothing before, because the checkpoint ran only after a successful operation.\n\nFull changelog: https://github.com/animatlabs/workflow-forge/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md#220---2026-09-15",
